   "text": "Hello Ivan, \nI hope you are doing well. I have a project in International Business. Can you answer these 2 questions with the point of view of a Paraguayan citizen (who live in Paraguay currently.) \n\nit's not urgent, do it when you can, when you have free time. \n\n1) “What do you think is the most difficult challenge for U.S. businesses that want to do business in your country?”  \n2) “What advice or suggestions do you have for American companies that want to do business in your country?”\n\nThanks again for your help man :)",
